WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.250
What happens if a helper drops out in the middle of an important task?

2
00:00:05.017 --> 00:00:10.517
This demo tries exactly that: one click starts the run, and a helper drops out halfway.

3
00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:15.083
A second helper takes over, and the task still gets finished.

4
00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:18.598
See for yourself: click Start run.
